  "description": "Replays a DaffyTee recording of real SQL Server traffic against a test or pre-production SQL Server - as fast as possible, one request at a time, or with the recorded timings - and reports what failed that did not fail before, and how the timings compare. Requests are replayed byte for byte from the wire-level recording, over DaffyReplay's own TDS client: exact parameter types, table-valued parameters, transactions, prepared statements and pooled-connection resets, with no server-side trace or Extended Events. Early release.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "DaffyReplay",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-10T19:35:52.62Z",
  "licenseFile": "LICENSE.txt",
  "licenseUrl": "https://aka.ms/deprecateLicenseUrl",
