  "projectUrl": "https://trobee.one/",
  "published": "2026-10-10T19:33:15.17Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0: First release. Replays DaffyTee (0.3.0 or later) recordings against a test SQL Server at recorded pace (with --speed), fast or serial; byte-exact from --raw recordings, with transaction descriptors patched and prepared-statement and cursor handles mapped; approximate T-SQL for procedure calls recorded without raw bytes. inspect, target, run, report and compare commands; report.json and a self-contained report.html. Tested with ADO.NET, EF Core, ODBC and JDBC workloads on SQL Server 2022 and 2025.",
